<font color="#D900D9">(RELIEVED)</font> Ahh!

677
00:49:15.238 --> 00:49:18.989
<font color="#D900D9">(FLUID TRICKLING)</font>

678
00:49:23.958 --> 00:49:24.958
Uh!

679
00:49:25.153 --> 00:49:26.904
<font color="#D900D9">(TOILET FLUSHING,
THEN DOOR UNLOCKING)</font>

680
00:49:41.954 --> 00:49:44.509
<font color="#D900D9">(ALARM BELL)</font>

681
00:49:45.645 --> 00:49:46.899
Hey! Stop!

682
00:49:52.531 --> 00:49:54.081
<font color="#808080">EDEN:</font> He's not coming back?!

683
00:49:54.731 --> 00:49:55.737
Can you believe it?

684
00:49:55.837 --> 00:49:57.370
<font color="#808080">PAULA:</font> No, I don't.

685
00:49:58.778 --> 00:50:01.061
But he is cute though...

686
00:50:03.854 --> 00:50:05.676
- I know.
- Uhum.

687
00:50:10.302 --> 00:50:12.384
<font color="#808080">PABLO:</font> You know I hate to say it,
but I told she wouldn't remember you.

688
00:50:12.526 --> 00:50:13.993
<font color="#808080">ADAM:</font> Pablo... please.

689
00:50:14.514 --> 00:50:17.720
<font color="#808080">ALBERT:</font> She got amnesia
...after all of that.

690
00:50:18.714 --> 00:50:20.713
Boy, you sure know
how to pick 'em.

691
00:50:21.920 --> 00:50:23.932
You burned yourself
pretty good there too.

692
00:50:26.144 --> 00:50:28.854
Put some more of that on,
tonight when you go to bed.

693
00:50:28.954 --> 00:50:29.989
Okay.

694
00:50:49.358 --> 00:50:51.582
<font color="#808080">ASSISTANT:</font> Everything alright, Mr. Kirk?

695
00:50:53.084 --> 00:50:56.445
Yes, yeah, yeah, yeah...
everything's fine, just uh...

696
00:50:56.545 --> 00:50:58.764
you know,
cleaning up a few things.

697
00:50:59.154 --> 00:51:02.450
Here's the list of candidates
for your clinical trial.

698
00:51:02.550 --> 00:51:05.058
Oh! Oh, great!
Thank you.

699
00:51:07.117 --> 00:51:10.276
I'll come by at the end of the day
for your selections.

700
00:51:12.831 --> 00:51:14.417
Psst! Hey!

701
00:51:15.162 --> 00:51:16.629
<font color="#808080">BOB:</font> May I see?

702
00:51:16.729 --> 00:51:17.729
Sure.

703
00:51:20.167 --> 00:51:24.781
Uh-ohh... man, Geez,
models like that...

704
00:51:24.881 --> 00:51:26.323
Your goose is cooked, man!

705
00:51:26.680 --> 00:51:28.898
What are they trying to do,
get fired or what?

706
00:51:28.998 --> 00:51:30.223
<font color="#D900D9">(BUZZING FOR ATTENTION)</font>

707
00:51:30.323 --> 00:51:31.750
<font color="#808080">BOB:</font> Show time!

708
00:51:33.738 --> 00:51:36.127
<font color="#808080">MAN:</font> - It's showtime, honey.<font color="#808080">
ADAM:</font> - What's that?

709
00:51:36.227 --> 00:51:37.665
<font color="#808080">BOB:</font> Oh, you'll see...

710
00:51:37.765 --> 00:51:38.962
<font color="#D900D9">(BOB SMIRKING)</font>

711
00:51:39.653 --> 00:51:42.386
<font color="#808080">BOB:</font> You just started here,
you'll be on to a lot of fun.

712
00:51:42.486 --> 00:51:44.246
<font color="#808080">LAGAVULLAN:</font>
<font color="#D900D9">(OVER PA)</font> <i>Your attention, please.</i>

713
00:51:44.267 --> 00:51:47.415
Before we begin
handing out the bonuses...

714
00:51:47.651 --> 00:51:51.674
<i>we have a list of individuals whose
services will no longer be required:</i>

715
00:51:54.407 --> 00:51:56.560
<i>Albert Midwall</i>

716
00:51:57.365 --> 00:51:58.938
<i>Susan Gonzalez</i>

717
00:52:00.654 --> 00:52:01.773
<i>John Phelps</i>

718
00:52:01.873 --> 00:52:03.103
Believe me, my friend...

719
00:52:03.316 --> 00:52:04.653
Your things works out.

720
00:52:04.753 --> 00:52:07.313
- You got nothing to worry about.<font color="#808080">
LAGAVULLAN:</font> <font color="#D900D9">(PA)</font> <i>- Jimmy Scotch</i>

721
00:52:08.250 --> 00:52:10.226
<i>Beatrice Amuchastegue</i>

722
00:52:11.054 --> 00:52:12.746
<i>Bob Boruchowitz</i>

723
00:52:13.680 --> 00:52:15.962
<font color="#808080">BOB:</font> - Nah, that's not me.
<i>- Alexis Vonarb</i>

724
00:52:16.062 --> 00:52:17.384
That's a mistake.

725
00:52:17.484 --> 00:52:19.005
<i>Edvan Soumache</i>

726
00:52:20.584 --> 00:52:22.317
Uhm, excuse me...

727
00:52:22.417 --> 00:52:24.745
<i>I'm sorry,
did you said 'Bob Boruchowitz'?</i>

728
00:52:25.299 --> 00:52:28.635
Well, uh, I think that's
a mistake, yeah?

729
00:52:34.445 --> 00:52:36.801
There is no mistake,
Mr. Boruchowitz.

730
00:52:37.379 --> 00:52:39.698
You lied of your seniority,
you will be given...

731
00:52:40.384 --> 00:52:41.934
<i>a retirement package,</i>

732
00:52:42.034 --> 00:52:45.714
<i>...but your TransWorld contract
has been terminated.</i>

733
00:52:52.910 --> 00:52:54.532
<i>Jeff Duhaim</i>

734
00:52:55.277 --> 00:52:57.324
<i>Emiliano Grassi</i>

735
00:52:58.578 --> 00:53:00.270
<i>Dimitri Rassam</i>

736
00:53:01.441 --> 00:53:03.003
<i>Oscar Lopez</i>

737
00:53:04.754 --> 00:53:06.493
<i>Steven Craig</i>

738
00:53:07.073 --> 00:53:09.558
<font color="#808080">BOB:</font> Don't ever trust
anyone here, Adam.

739
00:53:09.723 --> 00:53:11.344
All a bunch of snakes.

740
00:53:11.463 --> 00:53:14.113
<font color="#808080">ADAM:</font> That's it? I mean, you just
pack up your things and leave?

741
00:53:15.248 --> 00:53:19.549
<font color="#808080">BOB:</font> 31 years... They toss you out
like a bag of garbage.

742
00:53:20.513 --> 00:53:23.353
Yep, that's the TransWorld way.

743
00:53:27.115 --> 00:53:29.328
This is for your collection.

744
00:53:29.446 --> 00:53:32.238
<i>Some things in here
may come in handy.</i>

745
00:53:33.481 --> 00:53:34.498
You're ready?

746
00:53:34.847 --> 00:53:35.847
Yeah.

747
00:53:36.344 --> 00:53:37.344
Okay, and...

748
00:53:38.320 --> 00:53:40.649
I got it... I got it.

749
00:53:44.247 --> 00:53:45.679
<font color="#D900D9">(DOG WHIMPERING)</font>

750
00:53:46.105 --> 00:53:47.301
Hey, Bob.

751
00:53:49.063 --> 00:53:50.779
I'm really sorry.

752
00:53:52.364 --> 00:53:54.115
Don't worry about me my friend.

753
00:53:54.943 --> 00:53:56.481
It's their loss.

754
00:53:57.605 --> 00:53:58.649
Right.

755
00:54:00.208 --> 00:54:02.127
Take care of yourself, right?

756
00:54:03.568 --> 00:54:04.568
Right...

757
00:54:05.378 --> 00:54:06.479
Come on, old girl.

758
00:54:06.680 --> 00:54:08.332
We're out of here,
you're comin' with me.

759
00:54:08.620 --> 00:54:10.340
<font color="#D900D9">(DOG WHIMPERING)</font><font color="#808080">
BOB:</font> - All these jerks...

760
00:54:10.442 --> 00:54:12.501
...wind me up in a tin can.

761
00:54:13.258 --> 00:54:15.577
Come on, girl, come on.

762
00:54:17.269 --> 00:54:18.547
<font color="#808080">ADAM:</font> Hey, Bob...

763
00:54:19.836 --> 00:54:20.842
Thank you.

764
00:54:51.450 --> 00:54:53.829
<font color="#D900D9">(DIALING TONE)</font>
<font color="#D900D9">(SOFT TUNE FADES IN)</font>

765
00:54:55.023 --> 00:54:58.052
<font color="#808080">ANSWERING MACHINE:</font><i> Out of office,
leave your message.</i>

766
00:54:58.152 --> 00:54:59.151
<font color="#D900D9">(BEEP)</font>

767
00:54:59.152 --> 00:55:01.360
Hi, Bob,
it's Eden Moore calling you.

768
00:55:01.460 --> 00:55:03.380
I was just wondering
what happened the other day.

769
00:55:03.466 --> 00:55:05.288
You just rushed outta here...

770
00:55:05.430 --> 00:55:07.133
<font color="#808080">ADAM:</font> Mmpf...
E... Eden, Eden!

771
00:55:07.245 --> 00:55:08.245
- Hey.
- Hi.

772
00:55:08.553 --> 00:55:09.843
What happened to you?

773
00:55:09.973 --> 00:55:12.079
Listen, I'm... I'm...
I'm so so sorry...

774
00:55:12.179 --> 00:55:14.386
for disappearing
on you like that, uh...

775
00:55:14.505 --> 00:55:16.729
You know what, uh...
an alarm went off...

776
00:55:16.829 --> 00:55:18.977
and the security
had everything blocked, so...

777
00:55:19.095 --> 00:55:21.024
I was...
I was stuck for there for hours.

778
00:55:21.124 --> 00:55:22.183
- Uhum.
- No, no, really.

779
00:55:22.283 --> 00:55:24.845
I mean, I've been desperate
to call you, I...

780
00:55:25.153 --> 00:55:28.359
I've been meaning to call you.

781
00:55:28.459 --> 00:55:29.459
Alright, well...

782
00:55:29.559 --> 00:55:32.642
I'll let you make it up to me.
Take me to lunch.

783
00:55:33.683 --> 00:55:34.406
What?

784
00:55:35.115 --> 00:55:37.075
Yeah, you can come in with
a better story by then.

785
00:55:37.742 --> 00:55:39.984
Y... Y... You wanna go to
the cafeteria?

786
00:55:40.451 --> 00:55:42.628
No, I thought we could eat out.

787
00:55:44.533 --> 00:55:45.533
Eat out?

788
00:55:45.633 --> 00:55:47.107
<font color="#D900D9">(VOICES OF OTHER EMPLOYEES)</font>

789
00:55:47.207 --> 00:55:48.970
Yeah.
You don't want to?

790
00:55:49.703 --> 00:55:52.318
No, no, no...
I'd love to!

791
00:55:52.472 --> 00:55:53.572
Okay, great.

792
00:55:53.672 --> 00:55:56.980
Uh... how about
café 'Dos Mundos', you know?

793
00:55:57.394 --> 00:55:58.394
Yes...

794
00:55:58.660 --> 00:56:01.381
Of course, uh... wow!

795
00:56:01.771 --> 00:56:03.191
Café Dos Mundos.

796
00:56:03.291 --> 00:56:04.927
<font color="#D900D9">(GUARDS' VOICES IN THE BACK)</font>

797
00:56:05.375 --> 00:56:06.717
Is that a problem?

798
00:56:06.930 --> 00:56:09.557
No, no problem at all.

799
00:56:09.663 --> 00:56:12.372
Okay, great.
I'll see you tomorrow at noon.

800
00:56:12.472 --> 00:56:13.472
<font color="#808080">ADAM:</font><i> Okay, great.</i>

801
00:56:13.572 --> 00:56:14.786
Alright, see you then.

802
00:56:14.886 --> 00:56:16.229
<font color="#808080">ADAM:</font> <i>- Bye.</i>
- Bye.

803
00:56:17.117 --> 00:56:18.472
<font color="#D900D9">(TELEPHONE HANDLE CLICKS)</font>

804
00:56:18.702 --> 00:56:20.098
<font color="#D900D9">(SOFT TUNE FADING OUT)</font>

805
00:56:20.335 --> 00:56:21.660
<font color="#D900D9">(INDUSTRIAL CITY NOISE)</font>

806
00:56:22.387 --> 00:56:25.594
<font color="#D900D9">(SUSPENSEFUL TUNE)</font>

807
00:57:13.711 --> 00:57:15.226
<font color="#D900D9">(CONFIRMATION BUZZ)</font>

808
00:57:15.735 --> 00:57:17.687
<font color="#D900D9">(ORCHESTRAL MUSIC, BRASS)</font>

809
00:57:20.857 --> 00:57:23.164
<font color="#D900D9">(ORCHESTRAL MUSIC CULMINATING)</font>

810
00:57:23.670 --> 00:57:25.673
<font color="#808080">SOFT PA VOICE:</font><i> Welcome to TransWorld.</i>

811
00:57:26.028 --> 00:57:28.299
<i>Today it's 21 degrees,</i>

812
00:57:28.477 --> 00:57:31.446
<i>a beautiful and sunny day in TransCity.</i>

813
00:57:31.636 --> 00:57:34.583
<i>TransWorld wishes you a very lovely day.</i>

814
00:58:06.633 --> 00:58:09.568
<i>TransOil, energy for a better life.</i>

815
00:58:09.686 --> 00:58:11.792
<i>We're building your future.</i>

816
00:58:13.153 --> 00:58:16.193
<font color="#D900D9">(ORCHESTRAL MUSIC CONTINUES,
VIOLINS CULMINATING)</font>

817
00:58:51.339 --> 00:58:54.681
<font color="#D900D9">(MUSIC ENDING)</font>

818
00:58:55.344 --> 00:58:57.757
<font color="#D900D9">(PEOPLE CHATTERING)</font>

819
00:59:06.951 --> 00:59:11.091
<font color="#D900D9">(ROMANTIC MUSIC)</font>

820
00:59:21.977 --> 00:59:23.301
<font color="#808080">ADAM:</font> - Hey.
- Hi.

821
00:59:26.312 --> 00:59:27.312
<font color="#808080">ADAM:</font> How are you?

822
00:59:27.412 --> 00:59:28.412
<font color="#808080">EDEN:</font> Good.

823
00:59:29.087 --> 00:59:30.613
I'm so sorry I'm late.

824
00:59:30.713 --> 00:59:32.589
Oh, don't worry about it,
I just got here.

825
00:59:32.689 --> 00:59:34.387
Oh, you did? Oh, good.

826
00:59:34.813 --> 00:59:37.925
So, how come I've never seen you
around TransWorld before?

827
00:59:39.357 --> 00:59:42.303
Well, I mean it's a...
it's a pretty big company.

828
00:59:42.977 --> 00:59:44.622
I don't know, maybe that's why.

829
00:59:45.166 --> 00:59:46.586
Do you live nearby?

830
00:59:46.686 --> 00:59:48.775
Me? No, no, uh...

831
00:59:49.035 --> 00:59:52.288
I... I have a really long commute.

832
01:00:07.634 --> 01:00:12.166
You know, I'm sorry...
Y... You really don't remember me?

833
01:00:13.289 --> 01:00:16.378
I mean, if you... if you look at me,
like... I mean, really...

834
01:00:17.005 --> 01:00:18.005
really look at me...

835
01:00:18.992 --> 01:00:20.708
You don't remember me at all?

836
01:00:21.311 --> 01:00:23.950
<font color="#D900D9">(SOFT GUITAR MUSIC)</font>

837
01:00:24.092 --> 01:00:25.713
Come on, Eden...

838
01:00:26.943 --> 01:00:28.878
Eden, we know each other.

839
01:00:28.978 --> 01:00:29.978
- What? <font color="#D900D9">(MUSIC STOPS)</font>
- No, no, wait...

840
01:00:30.078 --> 01:00:31.285
We really know each other,
I mean...

841
01:00:31.463 --> 01:00:32.918
Why are you doing this to me?

842
01:00:33.438 --> 01:00:34.438
What?

843
01:00:34.538 --> 01:00:35.538
No, Eden...

844
01:00:35.675 --> 01:00:37.201
Eden, please...

845
01:00:38.940 --> 01:00:39.721
Damn...

846
01:00:39.821 --> 01:00:42.419
Eden, wait!
Wait, wait, wait...

847
01:00:42.519 --> 01:00:44.336
Come on, sorry...
Please, please, don't...

848
01:00:44.436 --> 01:00:46.311
It's just a misunderstanding.

849
01:00:46.678 --> 01:00:48.713
I just meant that we met before.

850
01:00:48.813 --> 01:00:51.067
You know, it was at the elevator...

851
01:00:51.167 --> 01:00:52.168
at work...

852
01:00:52.558 --> 01:00:55.256
You dropped your papers and
I helped you pick 'em up.

853
01:00:55.374 --> 01:00:56.983
- You don't remember that?
- No, I don't.

854
01:00:58.995 --> 01:01:01.704
Yeah, why...
why would you, I guess.

855
01:01:01.804 --> 01:01:03.467
Look, I... I'm sorry...

856
01:01:03.567 --> 01:01:05.798
I'm confused, a little nervous,
that's all.

857
01:01:05.987 --> 01:01:08.921
You know, I didn't mean
to come at you like that.

858
01:01:09.477 --> 01:01:10.885
I'm really sorry.

859
01:01:11.548 --> 01:01:12.932
Can you forgive me?

860
01:01:13.032 --> 01:01:14.127
Look...

861
01:01:14.227 --> 01:01:16.836
I should get back to work,
I think.

862
01:01:16.936 --> 01:01:18.599
Come on,
just stay for one drink.

863
01:01:19.037 --> 01:01:20.753
You can't stay for one drink?

864
01:01:20.883 --> 01:01:22.693
We don't even have to eat.

865
01:01:23.048 --> 01:01:24.048
You know, uh...

866
01:01:24.148 --> 01:01:25.266
I'm not even hungry.

867
01:01:25.366 --> 01:01:26.967
U... Unless, of course, you're hungry...

868
01:01:26.970 --> 01:01:28.703
in which case I'm... I'm...
I'm starving.

869
01:01:29.271 --> 01:01:31.649
Yeah, I mean, I'll eat
the whole menu... tw... twice!...

870
01:01:31.749 --> 01:01:34.051
...if... if... if you sit down
and have one drink.

871
01:01:34.643 --> 01:01:36.867
- I'm starving, actually.
- Yeah? Great.

872
01:01:37.057 --> 01:01:38.358
Wanna sit down?

873
01:01:39.683 --> 01:01:43.646
<font color="#D900D9">(ROMANTIC ORCHESTRAL MUSIC)</font>

874
01:01:45.599 --> 01:01:46.794
<font color="#808080">ADAM:</font> Isn't this upside down?

875
01:01:46.894 --> 01:01:49.055
<font color="#808080">EDEN:</font> I will teach you how to
drink that stuff, really.

876
01:01:49.219 --> 01:01:50.219
<font color="#808080">EDEN:</font> So...

877
01:01:50.322 --> 01:01:52.682
<font color="#808080">ADAM:</font> - How am I supposed to do it?<font color="#808080">
EDEN:</font> - You have to...

878
01:01:52.745 --> 01:01:54.839
- ...and you hold it like this...<font color="#808080">
ADAM:</font> - Okay.

879
01:01:55.845 --> 01:01:57.430
<font color="#808080">EDEN:</font> Tilt it down.

880
01:01:57.530 --> 01:01:59.181
<font color="#D900D9">(ADAM WHISPERING IN HER EAR)</font>

881
01:01:59.281 --> 01:02:00.885
<font color="#808080">EDEN:</font> What? <font color="#D900D9">(LAUGHING)</font>

882
01:02:02.104 --> 01:02:04.316
<font color="#D900D9">(EDEN LAUGHING LOUD)</font>

883
01:02:06.008 --> 01:02:07.901
<font color="#808080">ADAM:</font> - How could I know?<font color="#808080">
EDEN:</font> - For a year?

884
01:02:08.001 --> 01:02:09.401
<font color="#808080">EDEN:</font> - For a year?<font color="#808080">
ADAM:</font> - Exactly.

885
01:02:09.475 --> 01:02:11.676
Let's do it again.
A year. <font color="#D900D9">(CLINKING GLASSES)</font>

886
01:02:13.545 --> 01:02:16.029
<font color="#808080">ADAM:</font> - These are good.<font color="#808080">
EDEN:</font> - Yeah.

887
01:02:16.129 --> 01:02:17.461
<font color="#808080">ADAM:</font> - They're good.<font color="#808080">
EDEN:</font> - Yeah, take it easy.

888
01:02:17.561 --> 01:02:18.561
<font color="#808080">ADAM:</font> Alright. Strong...

889
01:02:18.661 --> 01:02:20.869
<font color="#808080">EDEN:</font> Hey, you know,
I wanna show you something.

890
01:02:20.969 --> 01:02:21.744
<font color="#808080">ADAM:</font> Sure.

891
01:02:21.844 --> 01:02:24.773
<font color="#808080">EDEN:</font> Uhm... it's a personal project
of mine, but...

892
01:02:25.388 --> 01:02:27.198
I wanna do it at a much larger scale...

893
01:02:27.298 --> 01:02:29.446
but I find your invention
could come in handy.

894
01:02:30.310 --> 01:02:32.877
Wow, that's...
That's amazing, really.

895
01:02:32.977 --> 01:02:33.599
- Yeah?
- Yeah.

896
01:02:33.699 --> 01:02:35.764
It's amazing, I mean...
I'd love to help.

897
01:02:36.356 --> 01:02:37.356
Yeah.

898
