1114
01:23:52.363 --> 01:23:53.676
<font color="#808080">POLICE OFFICER:</font> The guy fell.

1115
01:23:57.923 --> 01:23:59.533
<font color="#D900D9">(POLICE RADIO, INDISTINCT)</font>

1116
01:24:55.673 --> 01:24:59.057
<font color="#D900D9">(INDUSTRIAL NOISE,
OIL TRICKLING)</font>

1117
01:25:14.612 --> 01:25:17.274
<font color="#D900D9">(WIND HOWLING,
INDUSTRIAL NOISE)</font>

1118
01:25:20.983 --> 01:25:23.308
<font color="#D900D9">(HORN HONKING,
BRAKES SQUEALING)</font>

1119
01:25:23.758 --> 01:25:25.065
No, no, wait!

1120
01:25:28.136 --> 01:25:30.088
Don't do this to me! Ugh!

1121
01:25:30.230 --> 01:25:32.135
No, no!

1122
01:25:32.241 --> 01:25:34.442
<font color="#808080">ADAM:</font> - Oh, please, no!<font color="#808080">
AGENT:</font> - Get in the car!

1123
01:25:37.139 --> 01:25:39.612
<font color="#808080">ADAM:</font> <font color="#D900D9">(YELLING)</font> Ahh, no!
Don't do this to me!

1124
01:25:39.712 --> 01:25:40.795
<font color="#808080">AGENT:</font><i> Here's the deal...</i>

1125
01:25:40.895 --> 01:25:43.871
<i>You give us the complete
anti-aging cream formula</i>

1126
01:25:43.971 --> 01:25:46.593
<i>...and if you attempt to
contact Ms. Moore</i>

1127
01:25:46.693 --> 01:25:48.983
<i>...charges against her
will be reinstated.</i>

1128
01:25:49.113 --> 01:25:52.307
<i>Do I make myself clear,
Mr. Kirk?</i>

1129
01:25:56.922 --> 01:26:00.873
<font color="#D900D9">(ADAM COUGHING AND PANTING)</font>

1130
01:26:17.958 --> 01:26:19.733
<font color="#808080">ADAM:</font><i> So that's it.</i>

1131
01:26:20.336 --> 01:26:21.531
<i>They won.</i>

1132
01:26:22.525 --> 01:26:23.755
<i>And I lost.</i>

1133
01:26:24.797 --> 01:26:27.979
<i>- I just lost everything.</i>
<font color="#D900D9">(SAD PIANO MUSIC)</font>

1134
01:26:29.423 --> 01:26:33.528
<i>They took aunt Becky
and they took Eden from me.</i>

1135
01:26:35.185 --> 01:26:39.219
<i>Oh, it's hard to accept that I will
never see Eden again.</i>

1136
01:26:44.271 --> 01:26:47.930
<i>I was naive to think that
I can change the world.</i>

1137
01:26:48.814 --> 01:26:50.719
<i>You know, up there,</i>

1138
01:26:51.240 --> 01:26:53.038
<i>...they always win.</i>

1139
01:26:53.914 --> 01:26:55.760
<i>And down here...</i>

1140
01:26:56.103 --> 01:26:58.197
<i>Well, we always lose.</i>

1141
01:27:00.066 --> 01:27:03.473
<i>So I guess I just
go back to my life...</i>

1142
01:27:03.911 --> 01:27:05.473
<i>...to my world.</i>

1143
01:27:12.761 --> 01:27:14.832
<i>But I will never...</i>

1144
01:27:15.494 --> 01:27:16.654
<i>...ever...</i>

1145
01:27:18.298 --> 01:27:19.588
<i>...forget her.</i>

1146
01:28:09.115 --> 01:28:10.854
Gently does it...

1147
01:28:27.926 --> 01:28:29.050
Victory!

1148
01:28:42.171 --> 01:28:45.247
<font color="#808080">BOY 1:</font> So, is it true
everyone's rich up top?

1149
01:28:47.045 --> 01:28:49.660
<font color="#808080">BOY 2:</font> Don't you know,
it's total paradise up there!

1150
01:28:50.820 --> 01:28:52.086
<font color="#808080">ADAM:</font> Paradise?

1151
01:28:53.577 --> 01:28:56.014
Well, guys, I...
I don't think so, you know.

1152
01:28:56.357 --> 01:28:58.407
Th... they might be
rich, sure, but...

1153
01:28:59.469 --> 01:29:01.551
...it's definitely not paradise.

1154
01:29:07.242 --> 01:29:09.798
Hey let me look at that, huh?

1155
01:29:11.170 --> 01:29:14.412
What do you think, we should,
uh, think we should make this fly?

1156
01:29:14.577 --> 01:29:15.252
<font color="#808080">BOYS:</font> Yeah.

1157
01:29:15.352 --> 01:29:16.861
Oh yeah, we'll give it a boost?

1158
01:29:16.961 --> 01:29:18.127
Alright, hold on a bit.

1159
01:29:31.828 --> 01:29:34.005
Alright, now try.

1160
01:29:34.691 --> 01:29:35.691
Go on, throw it.

1161
01:29:40.252 --> 01:29:42.062
<font color="#D900D9">(PHONE RINGING)</font>

1162
01:29:46.776 --> 01:29:47.816
<font color="#D900D9">(ANSWERING MACHINE CLICKS)</font>

1163
01:29:47.876 --> 01:29:49.752
<font color="#808080">PAULA:</font><i> Hey, Eden, it's Paula.</i>

1164
01:29:49.852 --> 01:29:51.503
<i>Are you still sick?</i>

1165
01:29:51.603 --> 01:29:53.739
<i>You haven't shown up
for four days.</i>

1166
01:29:54.225 --> 01:29:57.076
<i>Did you get those strange
flowers we sent over?</i>

1167
01:29:57.502 --> 01:29:59.490
<i>I think they come from floor zero.</i>

1168
01:29:59.987 --> 01:30:01.217
<i>Let me know, okay?</i>

1169
01:30:01.548 --> 01:30:04.104
<i>I hope you're alright.
Bye.</i>

1170
01:30:04.204 --> 01:30:06.174
<font color="#D900D9">(ANSWERING MACHINE STOPS)</font>

1171
01:30:10.243 --> 01:30:11.982
<font color="#D900D9">(DOOR BELL)</font>

1172
01:30:14.396 --> 01:30:14.896
Bob?

1173
01:30:15.236 --> 01:30:16.414
Boruchowitz?

1174
01:30:17.780 --> 01:30:18.454
Yeah?

1175
01:30:18.554 --> 01:30:20.170
I'm Eden.
Moore.

1176
01:30:20.270 --> 01:30:21.601
I need your help.

1177
01:30:22.157 --> 01:30:24.749
<font color="#D900D9">(OIL HEAVILY TRICKLING,
INDUSTRIAL NOISE)</font>

1178
01:30:54.800 --> 01:30:56.014
<font color="#D900D9">(DOOR OPENING)</font>

1179
01:30:56.114 --> 01:30:57.829
<font color="#808080">BOB:</font> Yeah! Fantastic!

1180
01:31:00.136 --> 01:31:01.805
Bob... Bob!

1181
01:31:01.905 --> 01:31:02.935
What?

1182
01:31:03.035 --> 01:31:05.236
You think you're the only one
who can go upside down?

1183
01:31:05.336 --> 01:31:06.336
<font color="#D900D9">(BOB LAUGHING)</font>

1184
01:31:06.436 --> 01:31:07.614
You won't get rid of me!

1185
01:31:07.714 --> 01:31:08.998
Easy as that, old buddy!

1186
01:31:09.098 --> 01:31:10.371
How did you make this?

1187
01:31:10.471 --> 01:31:12.264
I mean, how...
how did you do it?

1188
01:31:12.364 --> 01:31:13.364
Hey, hey, hey...

1189
01:31:14.571 --> 01:31:16.002
Check this out!

1190
01:31:17.186 --> 01:31:19.303
<font color="#D900D9">(BOTH LAUGHING)</font>

1191
01:31:25.633 --> 01:31:27.798
Did you make a vest or what?

1192
01:31:27.898 --> 01:31:29.065
I can't believe it!

1193
01:31:29.549 --> 01:31:31.312
Oh, oh!

1194
01:31:31.412 --> 01:31:32.412
Put me down, sweetie!

1195
01:31:36.696 --> 01:31:38.458
You're not even wearing a vest!

1196
01:31:38.558 --> 01:31:39.351
- No, no...
- Where's the weights?

1197
01:31:39.523 --> 01:31:41.901
No, no, no... We're 90%
water, right?

1198
01:31:42.001 --> 01:31:44.339
So I combine
upper and lower inversion...

1199
01:31:44.439 --> 01:31:46.457
with a hyper... infusion, yeah?

1200
01:31:46.557 --> 01:31:47.663
Now, you know this better than I do.

1201
01:31:47.763 --> 01:31:49.770
But, but the breakthrough, man,...
the... the breakthrough, ahh...

1202
01:31:49.870 --> 01:31:51.319
Ahh, man, I'm jabbering...

1203
01:31:51.419 --> 01:31:52.419
The pro... <font color="#D900D9">(PANTING)</font>

1204
01:31:52.519 --> 01:31:53.828
The problem is, right,...

1205
01:31:53.928 --> 01:31:56.052
The effect only lasts an hour,
right? I'll improve it.

1206
01:31:56.152 --> 01:31:58.809
Oh... you, you my friend...

1207
01:31:58.909 --> 01:31:59.909
Hey, you...

1208
01:32:01.234 --> 01:32:02.950
you have a rendezvous.

1209
01:32:03.269 --> 01:32:04.441
What's this?

1210
01:32:08.901 --> 01:32:11.711
"CAFE DOS MUNDOS"

1211
01:32:14.071 --> 01:32:15.988
You better not go dressed like that.

1212
01:32:17.988 --> 01:32:19.372
Hey, did you tell him?

1213
01:32:19.472 --> 01:32:20.827
Hey, another thing...!

1214
01:32:20.927 --> 01:32:22.058
The cream...

1215
01:32:22.401 --> 01:32:24.176
Well, thanks to your stamps

1216
01:32:24.353 --> 01:32:27.630
...I bought the patent
under the name 'Albert & Co.'

1217
01:32:27.730 --> 01:32:28.730
...before...

1218
01:32:28.830 --> 01:32:30.068
TransWorld.

1219
01:32:30.434 --> 01:32:32.730
<font color="#D900D9">(BOB GIGGLING)</font>

1220
01:32:33.215 --> 01:32:34.646
Nice! Nice!

1221
01:32:39.379 --> 01:32:43.544
<font color="#D900D9">(ORCHESTRAL MUSIC, HEROIC)</font>

1222
01:33:15.654 --> 01:33:16.654
<font color="#808080">EDEN:</font> Adam!

1223
01:33:18.103 --> 01:33:19.103
Eden!

1224
01:33:20.198 --> 01:33:21.724
I can't believe it!

1225
01:33:22.954 --> 01:33:24.646
How did you get down here?

1226
01:33:25.320 --> 01:33:26.918
<font color="#808080">EDEN:</font> Bob found a way
to bring me down.

1227
01:33:27.521 --> 01:33:29.202
<font color="#808080">ADAM:</font> I can't believe it.

1228
01:33:36.572 --> 01:33:38.938
I... I... I don't know
what happened to you?

1229
01:33:39.755 --> 01:33:40.808
Are you okay?

1230
01:33:47.966 --> 01:33:49.634
<font color="#D900D9">(WHISPERING)</font> I'm pregnant.

1231
01:33:50.498 --> 01:33:52.190
We're having twins.

1232
01:33:59.644 --> 01:34:01.004
<font color="#808080">ADAM:</font> I can't believe it!

1233
01:34:06.033 --> 01:34:07.287
I can't believe it!

1234
01:34:09.724 --> 01:34:12.138
How long can you
stay down here for?

1235
01:34:12.292 --> 01:34:13.664
Forever, maybe.

1236
01:34:14.102 --> 01:34:16.622
Bob said
it's because I'm pregnant.

1237
01:34:16.722 --> 01:34:17.994
He said you'd understand

1238
01:34:18.716 --> 01:34:20.372
...how this makes me different.

1239
01:34:26.016 --> 01:34:27.069
I love you.

1240
01:34:28.441 --> 01:34:29.842
I love you.

1241
01:34:34.109 --> 01:34:37.351
<font color="#D900D9">(MUSIC CONTINUING)</font>

1242
01:35:12.147 --> 01:35:15.842
<font color="#808080">ADAM:</font><i> We didn't realize yet the
repercussions of what we had done.</i>

1243
01:35:16.501 --> 01:35:21.636
<i>Our love would forever
alter the course of history.</i>

1244
01:35:22.784 --> 01:35:25.138
<i>But that's another story...</i>

1245
01:35:28.770 --> 01:35:31.705
<font color="#D900D9">(CHILDREN CHEERING AND PLAYING)</font>

1246
01:35:34.769 --> 01:35:38.129
<font color="#D900D9">(MUSIC CONTINUING)</font>

1247
01:36:09.506 --> 01:36:13.162
<font color="#D900D9">(MUSIC FADING OUT)</font>

1248
01:36:15.008 --> 01:36:18.908
<font color="#D900D9">(END CREDITS MUSIC)</font>

1249
01:36:18.933 --> 01:36:20.933
<font color="#D900D9">(ENGLISH US - SHD)</font>
